          "环境管理体系": {
            "值": "公司持续完善环境管理体系，多个基地已通过ISO 14001环境管理体系认证，共8个基地获得认证：深圳拓邦、惠州拓邦、宁波拓邦、南通拓邦、拓邦越南、拓邦罗马尼亚、拓邦墨西哥、拓邦印度。",
            "原文": "Multiple bases of the Company have been certified to the ISO 14001 environmental management system. These qualifications are an authoritative recognition of the mature, standardized and effective environmental management system of the Company. Bases that have been certified to the ISO 14001 environmental management system (list): 1 Shenzhen Topband Certified; 2 Huizhou Topband Certified; 3 Ningbo Topband Certified; 4 Nantong Topband Certified; 5 Topband Vietnam Certified; 6 Topband Romania Certified; 7 Topband Mexico Certified; 8 Topband India Certified（第23页）"
          },
          "碳管理体系建设": {
            "值": "公司按照ISO 14064-1:2018、《组织温室气体排放量化与报告指南》(SZDB/Z 69-2018)、《组织温室气体排放核查指南》(SZDB/Z 70-2018)及深圳碳交易管控企业碳排放核查技术要点等标准，每年对范围一（直接）和范围二（间接）温室气体排放进行自查与核查。2025年惠州拓邦推进范围三碳排放核查。",
            "原文": "In accordance with ISO 14064-1:2018, the Guidance for Quantification and Reporting of the Organization's Greenhouse Gas Emissions (SZDB/Z 69-2018), the Guidance for Verification of the Organization's Greenhouse Gas Emissions (SZDB/Z 70-2018), the Technical Points for Carbon Emission Verification of Carbon Trading Controlled Organizations in Shenzhen, and the laws, regulations, and norms applicable to the places where the Company's production bases are located, Topband conducts self-inspection and verification on greenhouse gas emissions in Scope 1 (direct) and Scope 2 (indirect) within the organizational and reporting boundaries annually. In 2025, Huizhou Topband promoted the verification of Scope 3 carbon emissions and further implemented the carbon management responsibility throughout the value chain.（第27页）"
